WEBVTT

00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:00.097
KMS: So, you know,
the way I look at this, Simone,

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:02.463
is let's look at what
actually is happening

00:03:02.497 --> 00:03:04.897
and what happened to begin with.

00:03:05.363 --> 00:03:08.797
So to begin with, one of the things
that we actually learned was

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:14.230
the fact that small biotechs
were the ones who actually delivered

00:03:14.263 --> 00:03:16.930
on innovation and innovative vaccines.

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:19.263
So whether it was Oxford University,

00:03:19.297 --> 00:03:23.130
whether it was BioNTech
and whether it was Moderna

00:03:23.163 --> 00:03:27.963
and many other biotechs
like Novavax, et cetera,

00:03:27.963 --> 00:03:31.863
I think they were the ones
who actually pivoted very rapidly